@namespace FootballFormation.UI.Components

@* The three MudBlazor providers that only work inside an interactive render mode, rendered by each
   page that opens a dialog, a popover or a snackbar rather than once by the layout.

   The layout is applied by RouteView outside a page's interactive island, so it renders statically
   for every page — including the pages that declare a render mode themselves — and a render mode
   cannot be put on a layout at all: @Body is a RenderFragment and Blazor cannot serialise one as a
   root component parameter. Left in the layout these would be static, and known_issues.md records
   what that looks like: dialogs that simply never appear.

   MudThemeProvider stays in the layout on purpose. MudBlazor separated theming from the popover
   provider precisely so it can live in a static one, and the theme has to reach the whole page. *@
<MudPopoverProvider />
<MudDialogProvider />
<MudSnackbarProvider />
